No, it is sufficient just to throw in the stuff about incredible mastery
of an art that those old Bruce-Lee movies celebrate. Or those movies
with David Carradine, where he catches bullets with a piece of metal by
just holding it in the right place all the time. No magic involved, just
speed and concentration. (Not that I fully believe such a feat to be
