Agreed. So it should not approach artifact damage in general, in
particular not the damage of heavily enchanted artifacts. But there
should be a speed bonus at least, when you are two levels *above*
expert. Since non-enchanted artifacts do not always do exceedingly more
damage than ordinary weapons, artifact-like damage should be approached
at least sometimes by a grand master in martial arts. He should not be
inferior, say, to an unenchanted Magicbane. (I do not know how they
really compare.)



